{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-agreement","title":"质量与标注一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/labeling-systems/quality-agreement","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"质量与标注一致性\">质量与标注一致性</h1><p>让三个人独立标同一批一千条情感分类，你几乎一定会得到三份不完全相同的答案。这不是有人偷懒，而是标注本质上带主观判断——边界案例上理性的人也会分歧。问题是：这份带分歧的数据能用吗？分歧到什么程度该警惕？怎么从多份不一致的标注里逼近一个可信的真值？这一篇讲标注质量的量化与治理：用一致性系数把「标得有多齐」变成一个数、用黄金标准集把质量钉死、用裁决机制把分歧收敛成真值。它是上一篇 <a href=\"annotation-workflows\">标注工作流与工具</a> 里「质控」那一环的展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>标注质量有两个不同的问题：一致性（标注员之间标得齐不齐，agreement）和正确性（标得对不对，accuracy）。一致性高不代表正确——所有人被同一份烂指南误导，会高度一致地全标错。两者要用不同工具度量、不同手段治理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[多人标注同一批数据] --&gt; B[一致性度量&lt;br/&gt;标注员之间齐不齐]&#10;  A --&gt; C[正确性度量&lt;br/&gt;对不对]&#10;  B --&gt; D[Cohen kappa&lt;br/&gt;两人 / 类别型]&#10;  B --&gt; E[Krippendorff alpha&lt;br/&gt;多人 / 任意尺度 / 容缺失]&#10;  C --&gt; F[黄金标准集&lt;br/&gt;专家定真值]&#10;  D --&gt; G{一致性低?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[查指南歧义 / 培训]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; I[抽检准确率&lt;br/&gt;校准标注员]&#10;  H -.改进后重标.-&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[多人标注同一批数据] --&gt; B[一致性度量&lt;br/&gt;标注员之间齐不齐]\n  A --&gt; C[正确性度量&lt;br/&gt;对不对]\n  B --&gt; D[Cohen kappa&lt;br/&gt;两人 / 类别型]\n  B --&gt; E[Krippendorff alpha&lt;br/&gt;多人 / 任意尺度 / 容缺失]\n  C --&gt; F[黄金标准集&lt;br/&gt;专家定真值]\n  D --&gt; G{一致性低?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[查指南歧义 / 培训]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; I[抽检准确率&lt;br/&gt;校准标注员]\n  H -.改进后重标.-&gt; A</pre><p>下表对比两个最常用的一致性系数与朴素「百分比一致率」的差异——后者的致命缺陷是不扣除「碰巧蒙对」的部分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>是否扣除偶然一致</th>\n<th>容缺失/多标注员</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始百分比一致</td>\n<td>直觉参考</td>\n<td>否（高估）</td>\n<td>简单但不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cohen&#39;s kappa</td>\n<td>两标注员、类别型</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>仅两人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fleiss&#39; kappa</td>\n<td>多标注员、类别型</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>多人、需等量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Krippendorff&#39;s alpha</td>\n<td>任意人数/尺度</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>容缺失、最通用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不能只看一致率\">为什么不能只看一致率</h2><p>朴素的做法是算「两人标得一样的比例」。它的陷阱是没扣除偶然一致：在二分类里，哪怕两人都瞎猜，也有约 50% 的概率碰巧一致，0.5 的一致率毫无意义。Cohen&#39;s kappa 修正了这点，它把观测一致率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 减去偶然一致率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再归一化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = \\frac{p_o - p_e}{1 - p_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由两人各自的类别边际分布算出（假设独立猜测）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是完美一致，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是「不比瞎猜好」，负值表示比瞎猜还差。经验阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa &gt; 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 算很好，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 可接受，低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 该回头查指南了。</p>\n<p>类别不平衡时 kappa 会有反直觉行为（一致率很高但 kappa 很低，即所谓 kappa 悖论），这时要结合别的指标看。kappa 的「扣除偶然」思想和统计假设检验里区分「真效应」与「随机波动」是同一种警觉，参见 <a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/hypothesis-testing\">假设检验</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"krippendorff-s-alpha-最通用的一致性\">Krippendorff&#39;s alpha：最通用的一致性</h2><p>Cohen&#39;s kappa 只能管两个标注员、类别型标签。真实项目常常是几十个标注员、每条只被随机几个人标过（有缺失）、标签可能是序数甚至连续值。Krippendorff&#39;s alpha 是为此设计的通用系数，它基于「观测到的分歧」与「期望分歧」之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 1 - \\frac{D_o}{D_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际观测到的标注员间分歧，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是完全随机标注下的期望分歧。alpha 的优势是：支持任意数量标注员、容忍缺失数据、且通过可插拔的「距离函数」适配不同尺度——类别型用 0/1 距离，序数型用排序距离，连续型用差的平方。这种「按数据尺度选距离度量」的思想，和 <a href=\"../strategies/diversity-representativeness\">多样性与代表性</a> 里在表示空间选相似度度量是相通的。经验上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\geq 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 才算可靠数据，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.667</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.667</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.667</span></span></span></span></span> 是勉强可用的下限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"黄金标准集与裁决\">黄金标准集与裁决</h2><p>一致性高只说明标得齐，不说明标得对。要管正确性，需要黄金标准集（gold set）——一小批由领域专家精心标注、当作真值的样本。它有两个用途：上岗前<strong>校准</strong>新标注员（标一遍黄金集，对答案、纠偏），和过程中<strong>抽检</strong>（把黄金样本偷偷混进任务流，监控每个标注员的实时准确率）。一旦某人黄金集准确率掉到阈值以下，就暂停其工作、重新培训。</p>\n<p>当多份标注分歧时，要把它们收敛成单一真值，这叫裁决（adjudication / aggregation），常见三种。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>裁决方式</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多数投票</td>\n<td>取得票最多的标签</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>把所有标注员当同样可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权投票</td>\n<td>按标注员历史准确率加权</td>\n<td>抑制差标注员</td>\n<td>需先估每人可靠度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家裁决</td>\n<td>分歧样本升级给资深者定夺</td>\n<td>质量最高</td>\n<td>贵、慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>加权投票的高级形式（如 Dawid-Skene 模型）用 EM 同时估计每个标注员的可靠度和每条样本的真标签，是众包标注的经典方法，思想上和下一篇 <a href=\"weak-programmatic-labeling\">弱监督与编程式标注</a> 里融合多个噪声标注源的 label model 一脉相承——都是「从多个不完美来源推断真值」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性反馈进循环\">一致性反馈进循环</h2><p>质量度量不只是验收工具，还能反哺挑样。一致性低的样本（标注员吵得凶的）往往本身就是困难、有歧义的边界案例——这和 <a href=\"../foundations/query-strategies-overview\">委员会查询</a> 里「模型分歧大的样本信息量大」异曲同工，只不过这里分歧来自人而非模型。但要小心区分：人的分歧若源于<strong>任务固有歧义</strong>（偶然不确定性），标再多遍也定不下来，该做的是修指南或拆细类别，而非反复标——这又回到了 <a href=\"../strategies/uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a> 里偶然与认知不确定性的区分。把人的一致性信号、模型的不确定性信号、黄金集的准确率信号三者合起来看，才能判断一条样本是「值得多标」还是「定义本身有问题」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性（标得齐）与正确性（标得对）是两个问题：高度一致也可能集体标错。</li>\n<li>别只看原始一致率——它不扣除偶然蒙对；用 Cohen&#39;s kappa 扣除偶然一致，阈值 0.6/0.8。</li>\n<li>Krippendorff&#39;s alpha 最通用：任意人数、任意尺度、容缺失，靠可插拔距离函数适配。</li>\n<li>正确性靠黄金标准集治理：上岗校准 + 过程抽检；分歧靠多数/加权/专家裁决收敛真值。</li>\n<li>标注员分歧信号可反哺挑样，但要区分固有歧义（修指南）与认知困难（值得标）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"weak-programmatic-labeling\">弱监督与编程式标注</a>——label model 同样从多噪声源推断真值；<a href=\"annotation-workflows\">标注工作流与工具</a>——质控环节的产线背景。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/statistical-methods/hypothesis-testing\">假设检验</a>——「扣除随机波动看真效应」的共通统计思想。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"质量与标注一致性","id":"质量与标注一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不能只看一致率","id":"为什么不能只看一致率"},{"level":2,"text":"Krippendorff's alpha：最通用的一致性","id":"krippendorff-s-alpha-最通用的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"黄金标准集与裁决","id":"黄金标准集与裁决"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性反馈进循环","id":"一致性反馈进循环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"标注工作流与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/labeling-systems/annotation-workflows"},"next":{"title":"弱监督与编程式标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/labeling-systems/weak-programmatic-labeling"}}